  <item>
    <title>Met Gala简史，红毯背后的商业</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a15923113abca418579e78d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a15923113abca418579e78d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 12:41:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>时尚商业：</span></strong><span>每一年刷屏全网的Met Gala，观众看到的是明星红毯、高定礼服与海量热搜，但这场顶级时尚盛事的本质，从来不是简单的红毯晚宴。本期节目，我们将跳出造型点评视角，聚焦时尚商业核心。我们从Met Gala的起源与底层规则讲起，梳理其从1948年小众慈善晚宴，到由Diana、Anna Wintour迭代升级为全球顶级文化商业IP的百年历程，详解活动专属的邀请机制、主题逻辑与三层权力结构。同时全面拆解Met Gala四大盈利模式、奢侈品牌重金入局的底层逻辑，以及红毯流量、艺术热度到品牌资产、终端销量的完整转化路径。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>「时间线」</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a></span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><span>Met Gala简史：Eleanor Lamber的创立</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">06:46</a></span></strong><span> Met Gala的核心角色：与Vogue杂志的分工</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">09:03</a></span></strong><span> 两段黄金时期：Diana Vreeland 与 Anna Wintour</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a></span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><span>Met Gala的筹款方式</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1368">22:48</a></span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><span>Met Gala的流量与商业的转化</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a></span></strong><span> 活动伴随的争议</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>「主播」</span></strong></p><p><span>Alicia</span></p><p><span href=""><span>联系方式：hialiciayang@163.com</span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>「关于时尚是怎样」</span></strong></p><p><span>专注时尚商业（每周不定时更新）</span></p>]]></description>
